1
00:00:13,054 --> 00:00:15,434
(Sheldon:)I wish you could all be inside my head.

2
00:00:16,433 --> 00:00:18,643
(Sheldon:)The conversation is sparkling.

3
00:00:20,979 --> 00:00:22,769
(Sheldon:)Fine, I'll tell you.

4
00:00:22,939 --> 00:00:27,279
(Sheldon:)A lichen is an organism made up
of two separate species, fungi and algae.

5
00:00:27,485 --> 00:00:31,905
(Sheldon:)If you could merge with another species,
what species would you pick and why?

6
00:00:32,157 --> 00:00:34,327
(Sheldon:)Hint, there is a right answer.

7
00:00:36,077 --> 00:00:37,327
(Sheldon:)None of you will get it.

8
00:00:39,164 --> 00:00:42,624
Okay. Um, l'd pick swan
because, uh, the resuIting hybrid...

9
00:00:42,792 --> 00:00:45,882
(Raj:)...would have the advanced
industrial civilization of a human...

10
00:00:46,046 --> 00:00:49,296
(Raj:)...and the long, graceful neck
l've always dreamed of having.

11
00:00:51,384 --> 00:00:53,514
(Sheldon:)Wrong. Leonard?

12
00:00:53,720 --> 00:00:57,060
(Leonard:)Horse. But mostly just for the height.

13
00:00:57,599 --> 00:01:01,019
(Leonard:)A little bit for the genital girth.

